<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please review the attached document. If you have any questions or require any updates, please do not hesitate to reach out.&nbsp;If you would like to proceed with signature, let me know, and I will send out a version for signature.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have redlines, <b style="">please attach and reply to this email</b>.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We look forward to working with you and hope you have a great day!</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.OwnerFullName}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">{!Apttus__APTS_Agreement__c.OwnerTitle}</font></p>]]></td>
